 Just this once                                                          in C:\Projects\quiz-slayer

 Just this once, Claude Code will use work (you@work.example). Nothing is saved.

 Run it from any terminal. Put your own command after --:
+----------------------------------+
| devpit claude run work -- claude |
+----------------------------------+
 For example: devpit claude run work -- claude -p "summarise this repo"

 [c] copy the command  [enter] back














[keys] c copy  ·  enter back
